# The observer ring's fixture oracle is hashed byte for byte: every heartbeat,
# copy, fault and halt file's SHA-256 (trailing line feed included) is what its
# successors and its readers record, and several files are deliberately
# malformed. Git must never convert line endings in either direction here.
observers/testdata/** -text

# The deployment runs on a Linux host: shell scripts, systemd units and the
# example environment file must check out with line feeds everywhere.
deploy/** text eol=lf
